 "statement": "Fixed native guarded trace projection: all149776 original Fp2-pair/projected-lift comparisons agree across the preregistered p101 and p59 algebraic fixtures. The p101 q3 original24 members replay through the unchanged membership circuit;18 actual-field chart lifts replay the original norm and power equations, with nine positive-label inputs and nine conjugate-label controls. Six malformed/ramified/characteristic refusals and imaginary-coordinate mutations reject. Three classical polynomial identities are native evaluated in fixed32-point streams plus extra32-point streams with plus-one corruption refusal; this is not a formal proof of the adapter. Focused release test, formatting and strict all-target Clippy pass. Six compiled-in sources and the composite49-input snapshot match; no old43-input dependency source changed. This adapter discovers no decomposition roots and establishes no solving-cost exponent, performance ratio or signed scientific standing."
